cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the measured control law, please cite as below."
title: "medmem-law: memorization control law for medical image diffusion models"
abstract: >-
  Experiment code and every measured artifact behind the control law
  M(N, E) for small conditional-free diffusion models trained on public
  medical image datasets, including the calibrated memorization metric,
  the six candidate laws with censoring-aware fitting, the four stopping
  policies, and the full audit trail (CSV per measurement point, SHA256
  manifest, independent R re-implementation of the fit).
type: software
license: MIT
